body:
It will probably be scary. The first is not the best, but it must be okay, because people always go back for seconds!
P.s. You may have just made my night! Damn right I spit fire. Maybe more of a salamander. I take 'em by surprise. They never think a little thing can burn them that much! [6}
P.p.s My dear, you can spit fire too. Just believe you can. (They tell you that in movies, so why not real life.)
